# baseline-ingress admits only traefik, prometheus and the two cni0 gateways, so monitor-bridge
# needs this policy. PORT-SCOPED.
# traefik is listed so this policy states its complete caller set rather than relying on the
# baseline.
# Callers are `netpol_from:` on this role's entry; `netpol_role_owned: true` avoids a second copy.
{{ networkpolicy(container_item.name, container_item.port, container_item | netpol_callers) }}
